{"id":"n84998-2-7","stage":3,"title":"섞이다 · 被夹杂","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n84998-2-7-1","ko":"지영이가 내게 웃음이 섞인 목소리로 말을 걸 때면 가슴이 떨려.","zh":"每当智英用带着笑意的声音和我说话时，我的心就会颤抖。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지영이가","meaning":"智英","explanation":"지영：智英；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"지영이가","audio":"/audio/54469c93e7db862d00d4.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지영이가","audio":"/audio/54469c93e7db862d00d4.mp3"}},{"text":"내게","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"내게","audio":"/audio/ced087689b947fbe376c.mp3"}},{"text":"웃음이","meaning":"笑的行为；或指笑的样子或声音。","explanation":"웃음：笑的行为；或指笑的样子或声音；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"웃음","audio":"/audio/4f5bbfbe21d3bba84177.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"49095","senseId":"1","lemma":"웃음","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"웃음이","audio":"/audio/5f0014cccfd8c932ea7c.mp3"}},{"text":"섞인","meaning":"被夹杂，被夹带","explanation":"섞이다：被夹杂，被夹带；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"섞이다","audio":"/audio/bcfa52df7d2965e65a41.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84998","senseId":"2","lemma":"섞이다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"섞인","audio":"/audio/cf4afa834eb70eb7d0d5.mp3"}},{"text":"목소리로","meaning":"嗓音，声音","explanation":"목소리：嗓音，声音；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"목소리","audio":"/audio/47febdd9f8a457359397.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69464","senseId":"1","lemma":"목소리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"목소리로","audio":"/audio/c6ebd924c4d6bfd0a1f9.mp3"}},{"text":"말을","meaning":"话，语言","explanation":"말：话，语言；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"말","audio":"/audio/dfbb3ea79fc80c6f3f0e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27260","senseId":"2","lemma":"말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말을","audio":"/audio/e897e0419e4ab64902fd.mp3"}},{"text":"걸","meaning":"搭话","explanation":"걸다：主动搭话（말을 걸다）；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"걸다","audio":"/audio/a44925f8d8720a550d7d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65528","senseId":"13","lemma":"걸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸","audio":"/audio/6cebaf71218a575e8966.mp3"}},{"text":"때면","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"때：时，时候；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때면","audio":"/audio/4bb2837a9f54b8b6adbe.mp3"}},{"text":"가슴이","meaning":"心，心情，内心","explanation":"가슴：心，心情，内心；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"가슴","audio":"/audio/1bfa2a79f54c02d83437.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62908","senseId":"3","lemma":"가슴","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가슴이","audio":"/audio/df6f423237a54255dcc1.mp3"}},{"text":"떨려.","meaning":"发抖，颤动","explanation":"떨리다：发抖，颤动；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"떨리다","audio":"/audio/cc04aaccec373561a186.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69293","senseId":"1","lemma":"떨리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"떨려","audio":"/audio/e457d93e49731ca0914d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"4f5bbfbe21d3bba8","term":"웃음","zh":"笑的行为；或指笑的样子或声音。","audio":"/audio/4f5bbfbe21d3bba84177.mp3","entryId":"49095","definition":"笑的行为；或指笑的样子或声音。","pronunciation":["우슴"]},{"id":"bcfa52df7d2965e6","term":"섞이다","zh":"被夹杂，被夹带","audio":"/audio/bcfa52df7d2965e65a41.mp3","entryId":"84998","definition":"在某种言语或行为中，同时出现其他言语或行为。","pronunciation":["서끼다"]},{"id":"47febdd9f8a45735","